{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n「乃木坂46新内眞衣のオールナイトニッポンZERO」\n聴いてくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話出演させていただきましたー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、前回聴いてなくて\n今回初めて聴いたんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/07/3968456/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんが一人でずーっと喋ってて\nすごくパーソナリティー感めっちゃ出てて\nすごかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小並感でごめんだけど\n本当にすごいと思った！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんお疲れ様"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/07/3968456/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな まいちゅんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂46navi 即売会」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/07/3968456/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の昼から今日の夜まで\nまいちゅんとずっと一緒のお仕事"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しかよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は揃えたわけではないんだけども\nたまたま二人とも編み込みしてました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しかよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえずね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天気の悪い中、\n来てくれたみなさんありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/07/3968456/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベントはまず\nサイン入りグッズをかけたじゃんけん大会\nから始まりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイン色紙10名様と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイン入りCD5名様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDは先日発売された\n『ハルジオンが咲く頃』のtypeDですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その場でお名前を書かせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/07/3968456/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて、即売会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人一人、長い時間お話できて\n楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/07/3968456/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイン会って名前認知できるのが\n醍醐味だと思うの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「私、○○○だから！！絶対、次までに覚えといて！！」って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルに言いづらいわ～ とか\nどこのカナヲだよ！ とか\nって思うかもだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか\n中田がそうなんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイン会は自然に名乗れちゃうやつね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちからしたら\n名前を知れる機会にもなるから\nいいイベントですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/07/3968456/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平日だし\n17時からだし\nいろいろ都合をあわせて来てくれた方ばっかりだと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれて本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/07/3968456/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"brea